title: "dsh-paper-suite"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-bound paper toolchain for DeepSeek Harness: a LaTeX paper
  scaffold, a citation and claim-evidence audit, LaTeX build diagnostics with
  structured errors, and a whitelisted remote evidence sync, bundled with the
  paper-evidence and paper-latex-cn skills.
